From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] meta-xuantie: procps: use the upstream gitlab SRC_URI

Drop SRC_URI override pointing at unreachable Gitee mirror.
The upstream procps_3.3.17.bb already uses gitlab.com/procps-ng/procps.git
with the same patch files and SRCREV; no content is lost.

Modified by Canaan Creative Co., Ltd.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/recipes-extended/procps/procps_3.3.17.bbappend
+++ b/recipes-extended/procps/procps_3.3.17.bbappend
@@ -1,9 +1,3 @@
-
-SRC_URI = "git://git@gitee.com/t-head-linux/procps.git;protocol=https;branch=master \
-           file://sysctl.conf \
-           file://0001-w.c-correct-musl-builds.patch \
-           file://0002-proc-escape.c-add-missing-include.patch \
-           "
 do_install:append() {
     sed -i '/^net.ipv4.tcp_syncookies=1/s/^/#/' ${D}${sysconfdir}/sysctl.conf
 }
